# Open Rash - tracked: the source (incl. the original program's data tables src\runtime\game_data.c and resources src\resources\, so it builds on its own),
# build scripts (scripts\) and small tools. The game's content (graphics, sound, music, courses) stays local: supply your own copy of the game in data\.

# ---- Original game and its derived output ----------------------------------
/data/
/release/
# machine-converted C (old, now empty)
/src/auto/
# screenshots (P key in the game), video captures
/screenshots/
/recordings/
*.mp4
*.bmp
*.png
# README screenshots
!/docs/screenshots/*.png

# ---- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.res
*.log
*.err
__pycache__/

# ---- analysis\: local only - test / debugging scripts, notes, goldens, build output (analysis\build) ----
/analysis/
# third-party SDKs unpacked locally (SDL3: deps\SDL3-3.4.20, see readme.md)
/deps/

# ---- Local / machine-specific -----------------------------------------------
/backup/
/RoadRash.cfg
/.claude/
/.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# working notes (local only, user)
/RESUME.md
/CLAUDE.md
